{"video":"B233gSBrqQw","lines":[{"t":[0,1.3],"en":"- Sam? - Yeah?"},{"t":[1.9,3],"en":"Rip her head off."},{"t":[5,6.3],"en":"Rip my head off?"},{"t":[6.4,7.8],"en":"I'd love to see her try it."},{"t":[27.8,30],"en":"- Is that how you call it? - Let's go!"},{"t":[30.7,32.5],"en":"Tamp out! Tamp out!"},{"t":[37.7,38.8],"en":"Get out of here!"},{"t":[46.8,49.9],"en":"Oh, my gosh! Sam and Jade are gonna kill each other!"},{"t":[50.1,51.9],"en":"Don't bleed on my bed!"},{"t":[52.9,54.7],"en":"Yeah! Hey, come on!"},{"t":[55.2,56.5],"en":"Get out! Glee!"},{"t":[57.4,58.5],"en":"Girls, girls!"},{"t":[59.3,61.9],"en":"- Oh, hey! - Oh, you regained consciousness!"},{"t":[62.3,62.9],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[63.3,65.7],"en":"I... I thought you guys were fighting!"},{"t":[65.8,67.3],"en":"- Fighting? - Why would we be fighting?"},{"t":[67.8,69.3],"en":"Okay, why am I dancing?"},{"t":[69.6,71],"en":"This shouldn't be happening!"},{"t":[74.1,75.6],"en":"I am not enjoying this!"},{"t":[77.8,79.2],"en":"When did I learn these moves?"},{"t":[81.9,83.5],"en":"Someone tell me what's going on!"},{"t":[85.4,86.5],"en":"How am I doing this?"},{"t":[89.3,90.4],"en":"Hey, I'm not flexible!"},{"t":[90.4,91.3],"en":"What?"},{"t":[92.2,96.3],"en":"You think you can go between me and my Looper?"},{"t":[96.4,97.2],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[98.7,103.1],"en":"- Thanks, Sam. - Ah, no worries."},{"t":[103.2,105.2],"en":"I like hitting ladies with pineapples."},{"t":[109.7,110.7],"en":"- Ah! - Sorry!"},{"t":[110.8,112.5],"en":"- Are you okay? - Are you okay?"},{"t":[116.5,118.1],"en":"I'm... I'm fine!"},{"t":[118.6,122.1],"en":"Just next time, if you could throw the ball a little higher, that'd be great!"},{"t":[125.7,126.5],"en":"Hi there!"},{"t":[126.6,127.7],"en":"Spider!"},{"t":[128.1,129.2],"en":"Scout face bleeding!"},{"t":[130.4,131.4],"en":"- Stop! - Stop!"},{"t":[132.6,133.5],"en":"Who are you?"},{"t":[134.5,136],"en":"You're personal trainers!"},{"t":[137.5,140.3],"en":"- My personal... - Okay, come 