e ball!"},{"t":[245.5,246.4],"en":"All set."},{"t":[248.4,250.9],"en":"Okay, people. Unless you're a bowling pin..."},{"t":[251,251.8],"en":"Mel!"},{"t":[267.2,267.7],"en":"What's in it?"},{"t":[268.2,269.1],"en":"Uh..."},{"t":[269.7,270.6],"en":"Just..."},{"t":[272.5,273.2],"en":"This."},{"t":[273.7,275.3],"en":"- Just a lollipop? - Yeah."},{"t":[276.3,278.8],"en":"Except where I come from, we don't call it a lollipop."},{"t":[278.9,280.3],"en":"Oh, well, what do you call it?"},{"t":[280.4,281.5],"en":"- A sucker. - What?"},{"t":[310.4,311.9],"en":"Yeah, baby!"},{"t":[312,312.9],"en":"I'm a witch!"},{"t":[313,315.7],"en":"I am the ultimate assassin!"},{"t":[316.9,321.7],"en":"Now, which of you Americans would like to be the first to try a Canadian fat kick?"},{"t":[321.8,323.2],"en":"Hey, I wouldn't mind being the first..."},{"t":[327.7,328.4],"en":"May I?"},{"t":[330.5,332.5],"en":"- Okay, Sam, take a bite. - Shut up!"},{"t":[332.6,333.7],"en":"*BANG*"}]}
